#: changelogs/532.txt:1
#, max-length:500
msgctxt "changelogs/532.txt:1"
msgid ""
"- When searching contacts on contacts screen, show also contacts whose TEL URI matches the search string\n"
"- Improved contact URI labeling\n"
"- Fixed need to touch back button twice in order to leave chat screen"
msgstr ""
"- Visar även kontakter vars TEL-URI matchar söktexten vid sökning på kontaktskärmen\n"
