#: changelogs/67.0.2.txt:1
#, max-length:500
msgctxt "changelogs/67.0.2.txt:1"
msgid ""
"- Default Call Volume audio setting bug fix\n"
"- Backup/restore improvement and bug fix\n"
"- New translations (German)"
